  "description": "Plus, The Stock Screener Built Accuracy 83.3%, 38 Stocks Over 5% Gain Just A Few Days 🔎",
  "body_html": "<p>It is so nice to be doing mid-week movers again. If you are new, this is where we rank 10+ companies from first to worst. Wasn’t it nice to not have to worry about “buying the dip” and just being able to ride a trend for a bit? Anyways, we had 4 stocks that ranked at the top, all of which I think are great choices…it was tough figuring out first place 😬</p>",
